The '''Reflective Pond''' is a [[Location]] on {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.

{{ZoneText|Reflect upon the damage you have caused this land.|Contemplate what lies beneath.}}
== Features ==
=== Ice ===
{{See also|Ice}}
The '''Reflective Pond'''<nowiki/>'s surface naturally turns into {{Item|Ice}}, which can be broken. Breaking the ice reveals the water beneath, in which the player can fish up a variety of [[Sea Creatures#Winter|Winter Sea Creatures]]. Once the ice on the surface is broken, it will regenerate after a while and must be broken again to reach the water.

